            "id": 146314,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que definir a largura de um elemento filho para <code>100%</code> faz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Faz com que o elemento preencha toda a largura do elemento pai</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Faz com que o elemento se estenda até seu tamanho total</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Faz com que o elemento preencha toda a largura do elemento pai.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 146315,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que acontece quando definimos a largura deste rótulo da barra de saúde para <code>50%</code>?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Health Bar\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><content><text value=\"p\" class=\"selector-tag\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"50%\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"background-color\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": antiquewhite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Torna-se metade do tamanho do elemento <code>body</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ele se torna metade do tamanho do seu conteúdo</item></selection><webview visible-if=\"correct\"><![CDATA[<!doctype html><html> <head><style>p { width: 50%; background-color: antiquewhite; }</style></head> <body> <p>Health Bar</p> </body> </html>]]></webview><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Torna-se metade do tamanho do elemento <code>body</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 146316,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A que elemento uma porcentagem se refere quando aninhamos um elemento dentro de outro elemento, como um elemento <code>&lt;div&gt;</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">As porcentagens referem-se ao novo elemento pai</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">As porcentagens sempre se referem ao elemento <code>body</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">As porcentagens referem-se ao novo elemento pai.</p></body></html>"
